        "Web source 1",
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.hinckleypastpresent.org/hinckleyutah.html"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Erastus F. Pack first settled Hinckley in 1876, and the town was later surveyed into fourteen five-acre blocks.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        7,
        8,
        23,
        26
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia",
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hinckley%2C_Utah"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Hinckley won the Utah Centennial Cleanup contest in 1946 for being the cleanest town in the state.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
